window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"sett","b":"masteryi","win":["Sett","Sett","Sett","Sett","Sett","Sett","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Your passive fists and trade stats beat him outright — start swinging immediately."},{"when":"Level 3","text":"Facebreaker cancels Meditate outright — his only sustain, on a flat 10s."},{"when":"Level 6","text":"The Show Stopper suppress can flat-out kill him — force the all-in while you dominate."},{"when":"Yi late game","text":"Wuju Style's true damage and Highlander's slow immunity beat your HP — end it."}],"wants":{"you":["A stomp converted into towers and roams","The suppress landed before his resets start","The game closed before his full build"],"foe":["Survival into two-plus items","Your Facebreaker whiffed so he can spin free","Late fights where true damage melts you"]},"early":"You beat him at every stage of the lane: passive fists win level 1, the shielded Haymaker keeps you ahead at 2, and Facebreaker from 3 onward both starts your combo and cancels Meditate, his only sustain, on its flat 10s. His plan is surviving to late — deny farm, call dives, make the lane a nightmare.","mid":"Through 5 your HP and shielded true damage out-trade him, and at 6 The Show Stopper takes him out of the fight entirely. Alpha Strike is 20s at rank 1 and he is untargetable through the dash, so wait it out rather than spending your combo into it. Then snowball: all-in, tower, roam.","late":"At full build his on-hit and true damage finally out-scale your HP bar, and the duel stops being yours. Group and turn your kit into peel: Facebreaker his dive, suppress him mid-reset with your R, and let the team burst him inside the lockdown. You spent the game ahead — finish it there.","whys":["Your passive fists and trade stats beat him outright at level 1.","Your shielded Haymaker burst keeps you ahead through level 2.","At 3 Facebreaker cancels Meditate and starts your full combo.","Through 4-5 you out-trade him; Wuju Style is 14s and true damage.","At 5-6 your CC and burst keep the kill pressure firmly yours.","With your first item and The Show Stopper online, the suppress can flat-out kill him.","Late his true damage and Highlander's slow immunity beat your HP bar — end it first."]});
